<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Bad As I Used To Be"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Chris Stapleton"/><amll:meta key="album" value="F1 The Album"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="2718995371"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1810796708"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:49.564"><div begin="00:55.626" end="03:49.564"><p begin="00:55.626" end="00:58.625" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1"><span begin="00:55.626" end="00:56.316">I bet you'd </span><span begin="00:56.316" end="00:57.025">thought you'd </span><span begin="00:57.025" end="00:57.613">seen the </span><span begin="00:57.613" end="00:58.625">last of me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你一定以为再也不会见到我  </span></p><p begin="00:59.784" end="01:03.023" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2"><span begin="00:59.784" end="01:00.380">I can't </span><span begin="01:00.429" end="01:01.077">change </span><span begin="01:01.077" end="01:01.726">the way </span><span begin="01:01.726" end="01:02.131">I am </span><span begin="01:02.374" end="01:03.023">you see</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">但你看 我无法改变自己的本性  </span></p><p begin="01:04.054" end="01:06.927" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3"><span begin="01:04.054" end="01:04.488">I think</span><span begin="01:04.603" end="01:05.141"> it's my </span><span begin="01:05.161" end="01:06.927">responsibility</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我觉得这是我的责任  </span></p><p begin="01:07.155" end="01:10.930" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4"><span begin="01:07.155" end="01:07.748">To tell you </span><span begin="01:08.397" end="01:09.553">I'm just as bad </span><span begin="01:09.475" end="01:10.000">as I </span><span begin="01:10.107" end="01:10.930">used to be</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">告诉你 我和从前一样糟糕  </span></p><p begin="01:11.334" end="01:15.440" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5"><span begin="01:11.334" end="01:12.087">Yes </span><span begin="01:12.341" end="01:13.888">I'm just as bad as I </span><span begin="01:13.913" end="01:15.440">used to be</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">是的 我和从前一样糟糕</span></p><p begin="01:37.537" end="01:40.437" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6"><span begin="01:37.537" end="01:37.999">I tried</span><span begin="01:38.044" end="01:38.971"> changin' my</span><span begin="01:39.186" end="01:40.437"> reality</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我曾试图改变现实</span></p><p begin="01:41.680" end="01:44.948" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7"><span begin="01:41.680" end="01:41.805">But</span><span begin="01:41.928" end="01:42.684"> I don't think </span><span begin="01:42.799" end="01:43.958">it's gonna set me </span><span begin="01:44.215" end="01:44.948">free</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">但这似乎并不能让我解脱  </span></p><p begin="01:45.940" end="01:48.841" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8"><span begin="01:45.940" end="01:47.592">There's only one thing I can </span><span begin="01:47.602" end="01:48.841">guarantee</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">只有一件事我可以保证</span></p><p begin="01:49.119" end="01:53.127" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9"><span begin="01:49.119" end="01:49.867">And that's </span><span begin="01:50.017" end="01:51.727">I'm just as bad as I </span><span begin="01:51.852" end="01:53.127">used to be</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我依然和从前一样不堪</span></p><p begin="01:54.230" end="01:57.291" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10"><span begin="01:54.230" end="01:55.779">I'm just as bad as I</span><span begin="01:55.755" end="01:57.291"> used to be</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我还是和从前一样不堪</span></p><p begin="01:58.000" end="02:01.437" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11"><span begin="01:58.000" end="01:59.493">I'm just as bad as I</span><span begin="01:59.682" end="02:01.437"> used to be</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我还是和从前一样不堪</span></p><p begin="02:02.180" end="02:05.423" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12"><span begin="02:02.180" end="02:04.277">I'm just as bad as I </span><span begin="02:04.457" end="02:05.423">used to be</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我还是和从前一样不堪</span></p><p begin="03:20.810" end="03:23.683" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13"><span begin="03:20.810" end="03:22.093">No one's accusin' me of</span><span begin="03:22.255" end="03:23.683"> sanity</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">没人指责我神志清醒</span></p><p begin="03:24.959" end="03:28.375" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14"><span begin="03:24.959" end="03:26.605">I ain't everybody's </span><span begin="03:26.679" end="03:28.375">cup of tea</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我不是人人都喜欢的类型</span></p><p begin="03:29.250" end="03:32.051" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15"><span begin="03:29.250" end="03:30.781">But that's the facts I'm talkin' </span><span begin="03:30.905" end="03:32.051">factually</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">但这就是事实 我实话实说</span></p><p begin="03:32.273" end="03:36.163" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16"><span begin="03:32.273" end="03:33.186">You know </span><span begin="03:33.118" end="03:33.795">I'm just as</span><span begin="03:34.024" end="03:35.040"> bad as I </span><span begin="03:35.100" end="03:36.000">used to be</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你知道我还是和从前一样不堪</span></p><p begin="03:36.490" end="03:40.544" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17"><span begin="03:36.390" end="03:37.077">Yes </span><span begin="03:37.570" end="03:38.211">I'm just as</span><span begin="03:38.242" end="03:39.461"> bad as I </span><span begin="03:39.487" end="03:40.344">used to be</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">是的 我和从前一样糟糕  </span></p><p begin="03:40.940" end="03:44.607" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18"><span begin="03:40.940" end="03:41.433">Whoa</span><span begin="03:41.407" end="03:42.716"> I'm just as</span><span begin="03:42.722" end="03:43.090"> bad as I</span><span begin="03:43.090" end="03:44.607"> used to be</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">哇哦 我还是和从前一样糟糕</span></p><p begin="03:45.386" end="03:49.564" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19"><span begin="03:45.386" end="03:46.617">I'm just as </span><span begin="03:46.632" end="03:47.248">bad</span><span begin="03:47.279" end="03:47.713"> as I </span><span begin="03:47.713" end="03:49.464">used to be</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我还是和从前一样不堪</span></p></div></body></tt>